Package: manuscriptguard
Title: Emit Analysis Results for manuscript-guard
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Basile", "Chrétien", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "chretien.basile.jean.bernard.u4@s.mail.nagoya-u.ac.jp",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7483-2489"))
Description: Writes the results fragment that a manuscript-guard project reads, together
    with the provenance needed to tell whether it is still current: the script that
    produced it, hashes of every input file, the git commit, and the session. The
    manuscript quotes these values by key, so a number can never be carried across by
    hand.
